{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear the stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve different clear conditions for each stage by defeating or escaping from various types of ghosts. As you progress through the stages, it becomes more difficult to clear. You may not be able to clear the stage just by defeating the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u21e9A little introduction to some of the missions\u21e9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDefeat 13 or more ghosts by Phase 10!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEscape until Phase 15!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many other missions! Check them out for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various ghosts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various ghosts appear in each stage. Each ghost has a different way of moving and attacking. Figure out how they move.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822370?t=1771253199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822370/6be2ff6acea5a87a0f5d4149248bb6b414a23623/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771253199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822370/861b3ad77b8fbadc3abac7815d986f6cd5584257/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771253199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822370/861b3ad77b8fbadc3abac7815d986f6cd5584257/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771253199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear the stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve different clear conditions for each stage by defeating or escaping from various types of ghosts. As you progress through the stages, it becomes more difficult to clear. You may not be able to clear the stage just by defeating the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u21e9A little introduction to some of the missions\u21e9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDefeat 13 or more ghosts by Phase 10!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEscape until Phase 15!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many other missions! Check them out for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various ghosts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various ghosts appear in each stage. Each ghost has a different way of moving and attacking. Figure out how they move.</p>","developers":["\u3042\u308b\u3072\u3068"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822370/0adb708eaeacb9bf2c1506d9af6d47c8d42b0116/header.jpg?t=1771253199","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u3010BGM\u3011<br />\r\n\u30fbDead End Wonder<br />\r\n\u30fb\u30e6\u30fc\u30d5\u30eb\u30ab","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u7953\u30ce\u72d0","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 770<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 14400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li><